00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:57.140
Senpai... Now I get it.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:58.270
Get what?

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.940
I now know why you said you like conflict.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.730
I never said I liked it.

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:07.430
Now I'm really thankful I didn't leave 
all of this up to you guys, Senpai.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.040
We'll be bringing peace to this country!

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:11.660
If you'll excuse me!

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:17.350
Gelu-lu-lu-lu!

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.160
Gelu-lu-lu-lu!

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:22.880
Tsubasa-chan... You're a Gatchaman, though.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:26.510
You're way more Gatchaman than me.

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:29.380
And now a hint! Da-dan!

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:34.180
The answer to the riddle 
is definitely my favorite thing.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:38.830
But that Gel-Gel guy likes it twenty 
thousand times more than me.

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:40.660
See you next week!

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:43.130
Thanks, Katze-san!

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:49.820
<b>The Mysterious Beings, Kuu-sama Invade!! But They're Actually Nice Guys?!</b>

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.760
<i>We will get to the truth 
behind the Kuu-samas</i>

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:49.820
<i>that have been causing such a fuss lately!</i>

00:16:49.820 --> 00:17:13.880
<b>Investigation: The Super Popular Mysterious Beings! 
What's the City's Reaction to Kuu-sama?</b>

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:55.070
<i>At first, I was scared, but once 
it hugged me, I felt so at ease...</i>

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.610
<i>But when I looked at it more carefully,</i>

00:16:57.610 --> 00:17:01.900
<i>it was super cute and totally did the Gel 
sign, so I thought we could be friends.</i>

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:03.510
<i>Right, Kuu-sama?</i>

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.880
<i>I feel like he really gets me...</i>

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:09.050
<i>Like he knows everything about me.</i>

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.970
<i>I took him home, and we drank until morning.</i>

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:14.970
<b>Miracle Collaboration Between 
Millio and Kuu-sama!</b>

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:19.040
<i>And so, our special guests 
today, are these guys!</i>

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.520
Kuu-sama!

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:26.020
I wanted to meet Millio, too.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:31.280
<b>Right!   No Way!
Let Sadra Handle It.</b>

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:31.280
"Should Kuu-sama be allowed 
to stay in Japan?"

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:34.320
Well, they're just going to have to.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.140
Right?

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.370
Ah, wait.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:41.550
Instead of us deciding, 
wouldn't it be better if Gel-chan decided?

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:44.420
That might be better.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:45.750
Right?

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:46.620
<b>Right!   No Way!
Let Sadra Handle It.</b>

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:55.800
What's the matter, Umeda-san?

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:59.790
It's okay. We don't discriminate.

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:01.960
You may have done something 
bad before, Umeda-san,

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:04.590
but you're working like 
a good, honest person now.

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:06.950
Shut up! Just leave me alone!

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.140
Why won't everyone become one yet?

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:23.740
Why can't I inhale yet?

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:27.050
At this rate, I'll never know 
what everyone is thinking...

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.840
<b>Bicycle | Pedestrian
Light</b>

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:45.220
There, there.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.190
Thank you...

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:49.670
Pardon me...

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.560
Is everything okay?

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:53.550
What?

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:55.900
Say, you're actually lonely, right?

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:56.780
What?!

00:18:58.230 --> 00:19:00.230
You shouldn't be alone.

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:01.850
Become one with us.

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:03.050
What the hell?!

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:04.030
Leave me alone!

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:06.480
What's with those guys?

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:09.460
Kuu-sama's being so nice to them...

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:10.900
It'd be better...

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:12.630
If they just disappeared.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:15.120
What should we do?

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.160
See you.

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:18.030
See you.

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:20.450
Come by my place sometime soon.

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:23.850
Well, I guess I should get ready to open.

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.490
I figured out the riddle.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:47.890
Really, Hajime-tan?

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:51.000
This isn't Gel-chan.

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:52.500
Oh-ho?

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:56.560
Is that what it means by 
there's more than one name?

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.470
This is how it should be, Rui-Rui.

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:07.110
I'm sure you're probably really tired 
from risking your life for so long, right?

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:10.520
Yeah... that might be true.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:14.860
Rest well, Rui-Rui. Let's all become one.

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.220
There, there.

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:20.030
Thanks, everyone. Ah, this is great.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:23.360
I never knew there was 
such a comfortable world.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:28.240
Rui, I have determined the origin 
of the mysterious beings called "Kuu-sama."

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:31.750
X, that doesn't matter anymore.

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:34.310
Rui! Please get a hold of yourself!

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:38.420
Updating the world, which is 
your dream, has not happened yet.

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:40.930
Update?

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:44.020
I guess I used to say that a lot.

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:46.520
It doesn't matter anymore, X.

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:50.020
No one listens to me, anyway...

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:53.190
I just want to stay like this forever...

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:53.730
Rui!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:57.060
You know, I became an ape.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.690
Gelu-lu-lu!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.320
Gelu-lu-lu!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:04.530
Rui, please get a hold of yourself! Rui!

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:08.210
Thank goodness. 
Rui-Rui became one with us.

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:09.320
Right?

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:13.290
If he hadn't, something really 
bad would have happened.

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:17.040
Rui! Please wake up! Rui!

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:19.530
Alan.

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:21.170
Hey, Jou.

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:23.630
Wanna go a few rounds, like old times?

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:25.070
Bring it on.

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:33.600
Alan!

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:39.320
Now we've become one!

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:42.070
Gelu-lu-lu!
